13
00:00:33,734 --> 00:00:34,724
On one side,

14
00:00:34,724 --> 00:00:36,084
America and the West,

15
00:00:36,084 --> 00:00:37,284
with capitalism

16
00:00:37,284 --> 00:00:38,004
On the other,

