00:00:38,004 --> 00:00:40,484
the Soviet Union and Eastern Europe,

18
00:00:40,484 --> 00:00:41,924
with communism

19
00:00:44,006 --> 00:00:46,476
On the fifth of March 1946,

20
00:00:46,476 --> 00:00:48,276
in a small town in Missouri,

21
00:00:48,276 --> 00:00:49,476
Churchill declared:

