72
00:03:10,683 --> 00:03:12,113
In 1952,

73
00:03:12,113 --> 00:03:14,793
America tested the first hydrogen bomb

74
00:03:14,793 --> 00:03:17,273
It was roughly seven hundred times more

75
00:03:17,273 --> 00:03:19,873
