The Soviets were ahead again

175
00:08:11,253 --> 00:08:12,333
A month later,

176
00:08:12,333 --> 00:08:14,933
President Kennedy promised to put an American

177
00:08:14,933 --> 00:08:17,533
on the Moon before the decade was out

178
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:26,880
By 1961,

179
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:29,880
around two and a half million East Germans had

180
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,080
