185
00:08:41,650 --> 00:08:45,080
At midnight on the twelfth of August 1961,

186
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:48,080
the street lights in Berlin suddenly went out

187
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:51,400
Tens of thousands of East German soldiers and

188
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,800
