192
00:09:06,869 --> 00:09:07,899
Two days later,

193
00:09:07,899 --> 00:09:10,739
a nineteen-year-old border guard named Conrad

194
00:09:10,739 --> 00:09:13,419
Schumann suddenly leapt over the barbed wire to

195
00:09:13,419 --> 00:09:14,099
the West

196
00:09:14,099 --> 00:09:16,699
